{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">CREATE SERVER statement</span>\n","class":"manual","created":1470,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/309173","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/CREATE-SERVER-statement.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/CREATE-SERVER-statement.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"CREATE-SERVER-statement\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">CREATE SERVER statement</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"CREATE-SERVER-statement__section_N1002D_N1002A_N10001\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Creates an instance of a server object and\nassigns its handle to the handle variable you specify.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"CREATE-SERVER-statement__syntax_GC15AO2683964\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d46199e101\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"CREATE-SERVER-statement__idGDG23A2664765\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>CREATE SERVER <var class=\"keyword varname\">handle</var>\n  <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">[</strong> ASSIGN <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">{</strong> <var class=\"keyword varname\">attribute</var> = <var class=\"keyword varname\">expression</var> <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">}</strong> <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">...</strong> <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">]</strong></code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <dl class=\"dl parml\">\n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">handle</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">A variable of type HANDLE into which CREATE SERVER stores the\nnew server handle.</dd>\n        \n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">ASSIGN <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">{</strong><var class=\"keyword varname\">attribute\n= expression</var><strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">}</strong><strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">...</strong></dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">Assigns specified values to attributes of the handle. The <var class=\"keyword varname\">attribute</var> parameter\nmust be the name of a valid attribute for a server handle, and the <var class=\"keyword varname\">expression</var> parameter\nmust evaluate to a valid value for the attribute.</dd>\n        \n      </dl>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"CREATE-SERVER-statement__notes_GC15AP2683984\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d46199e189\">Note</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">You can\nuse a server handle as a connection point to an AppServer™. For more\ninformation on server handles, see the <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"Server-object-handle.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/Server-object-handle.html\">Server object handle</a> entry.\nFor more information on AppServers, see <cite class=\"cite\">OpenEdge Application\nServer: Developing AppServer Applications</cite>.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"CREATE-SERVER-statement__see-also_GC15AQ2683991\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d46199e205\">See also</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"DELETE-OBJECT-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/DELETE-OBJECT-statement.html\">DELETE OBJECT statement</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"RUN-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/RUN-statement.html\">RUN statement</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"Server-object-handle.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/Server-object-handle.html\">Server object handle</a></p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"CREATE-SAX-WRITER-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/CREATE-SAX-WRITER-statement.html\">CREATE SAX-WRITER statement</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"CREATE-SERVER-SOCKET-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/CREATE-SERVER-SOCKET-statement.html\">CREATE SERVER-SOCKET statement</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/309173","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":1318,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"CREATE SERVER statement","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/CREATE-SERVER-statement.html","type":"Manual"}